/P 272 0 R
/E (     Timestamp inputs need an explicit zone and at most three fractional digits. HH:mm means seconds 00; deadline and rejection context display seconds in Asia/Bangkok, with UTC storage. First-submission errors after authentication/input/scope follow cancelled -> duplicate -> deadline precedence. A duplicate after due still returns ALREADY_SUBMITTED.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [23]
>>
endobj
419 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 272 0 R
/E (Mutation transactions share team -> milestone lock order, recheck scope with the same transaction client and perform no external HTTP calls while holding locks. Retry at most three times only for confirmed rolled-back technical contention, reading rules/time again. Unknown outcomes are checked through GET before an explicit retry. Feedback uses a clientRequestId per intent: replay with the same target/content returns the existing record; a changed intent with the same key returns 409 after scope checking. No automatic first-submission POST retry is permitted.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [24]
>>
endobj
